    "created_at": "2020-05-19T17:56:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-19T17:56:44Z",
    "body": "Seeing as this is the biggest breaking change to Starship configuration in the foreseeable future, it's probably a good time to finally go `v1.0.0`. I kept waiting until the project felt a little more \"stable\", but I don't know that it'll be the case until a full rewrite (the work being done at https://github.com/matchai/starship-poc).\r\nWhat are your thoughts?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
